chapter.v:
This is 


the law, 


for a case of leprous disease in a garment of wool or linen, either in the warp or the woof, or in any article made of skin, to determine whether it is clean or unclean. Footnotes (1) 13:2 *Leprosy* was a term for several skin diseases (2) 13:45 Or *mustache* (ESV)
